    "user_title": "Analyze Geospatial Data with GeoPandas",
    "value_statement": "Geospatial work often fails when file formats, coordinate systems, and spatial operations are unclear. This skill provides GeoPandas patterns for loading, transforming, analyzing, and mapping vector data.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "GeoPandas",
      "geospatial analysis",
