    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Explains reading and writing Shapefile, GeoJSON, GeoPackage, Parquet, Feather, and PostGIS data.",
      "Guides CRS checks, assignment, coordinate transformations, and projection choices for analysis.",
      "Shows spatial joins, nearest joins, overlays, clipping, dissolving, and measurement workflows.",
      "Covers buffers, centroids, simplification, affine transforms, and geometry validity checks.",
      "Describes static plots, choropleth maps, interactive maps, basemaps, and CartoPy maps.",
      "Provides performance guidance for spatial indexing, filtered reads, Arrow I/O, and geometry simplification."
    ],
    "limitations": [
